category: Libs
requires: libmdbx0 pkg-config
sdesc: "One of the fastest embeddable key-value ACID database (development)"
ldesc: "libmdbx is an extremely fast, compact, powerful, embedded, transactional
key-value database, with permissive license. libmdbx has a specific set of
properties and capabilities, focused on creating unique lightweight solutions."
external-source: libmdbx

